{"version":1,"content":"<p>家陣天氣清爽，最適合約埋朋友一齊踩單車，有冇諗過向自己心儀嘅異性提出邀請？</p><p>今日出場嗰班男車友就好識玩，統統搵到啱Key美女陪自己踩車，經過一輪熱身，最終發生超友誼關係，為成個旅程畫上難忘句號！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;靈慾</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.538426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:45.191411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:45.191411+00:00","content_hash":"7c579ad548dfda2f3a83a099c0eaf508ca53b54f91b291f513100c1a4d9800d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}